    "scientific_conclusion": "Across multiple recovery delays (5 min, 45 min, 24 h), workload volume in kg\u00b7reps consistently fails to improve upon the simple empirical retention baseline. At 5 min, the volume model worsens MAE by 4.08 N [-8.49, -0.29] N; at 45 min, it worsens MAE by 4.38 N [-7.61, -1.91] N. Relative load intensity (30% vs 70% 1RM) similarly provides no predictive advantage. Resistance workload does not monotonically govern post-exercise isometric strength."
